ight. are They best as questionable allies that makes body disappear for you? or as atagonists? If they are antagonists, them would they fir best on a murder investigation game?<br /> <br /> <br /> And finally, which powers would Amkhat gain by eating the above mentioned supernaturals? Would they ge enchanted by eating a changeling? Would they become some kind of special ghoul by consuming vampires? Maybe a ghoul that can use disciplines higher than the limit? And what if they consume the heart of a garou? To they get acess to fury? Im really interested in any suggestions!<br /> <br /> <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":26021,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26021-rucun","user":"Rucun","date":". 05-09-2020, 10:52 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/26021-rucun","name":"Rucun","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2020"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"113"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-05-11T06:56:39-07:00","id":1387477,"title":"","content":"I'm always a big fan of using Antagonists and Resources from one gameline to for other games, and Mummy has some juicy bits. So bump.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/754-eldagusto","name":"Eldagusto","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar754_2.gif","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"6435"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}